# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132) available, the job alone either side of 15 (both level 66 at cap 70): main a Blue Mage
# (job 16, not an original job): no section, MAAT_DIALOG (Beyond the Sun wants Shattering Stars completed); smn a
# Summoner (job 15): 92 (15) (begun); then 91 (15).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/92
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=BLU lvl=66
char smn zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=SMN lvl=66
levelcap 70
smn: levelcap 70
login
trigger Maat                            # job 16: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
smn: login
smn: trigger Maat                       # job 15: 92 (15)
smn: finish                             # begun
smn: trigger Maat                       # accepted, job 15: 91 (15)
smn: finish
